        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lesser youkai of Gensokyo have long since seen the truth: whether during incident resolutions or in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >everyday life, the Hakurei shrine maiden and her allies never spare a thought for their feelings, bullying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >them however they please.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having endured enough, the lesser youkai decide to fight back. They form the <strong>Youkai Reform</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organization</strong>, using a lively youkai bar as their base of operations, recruiting like-minded allies from far</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and wide. In this glorious rebellion from below, they swear to reclaim the justice that belongs to them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/dacef9050ff22161ad3caa741a7e4c61.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/dacef9050ff22161ad3caa741a7e4c61.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/dacef9050ff22161ad3caa741a7e4c61.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touhou Drunken Rebellion</strong> is a top-down danmaku shooting roguelike. Players take on the role of lesser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >youkai from Gensokyo and rise up against the powerful fgures who rule over it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out from your base and defeat every enemy you encounter! Unleash gorgeous, devastating danmaku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >barrages, or make clever use of special abilities and combat techniques. Along the way, collect a wide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >variety of drinks with unique passive efects, defeat the fnal boss, and bring your operation to a perfect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >conclusion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/0cb1ff9fec05adc7cd392c3893dd1d57.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/0cb1ff9fec05adc7cd392c3893dd1d57.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/0cb1ff9fec05adc7cd392c3893dd1d57.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~The Forgotten Karakasa Youkai~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kogasa Tatara  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/b56fd5b1f0d0a7fc3b6b0ded58e20d3d.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/b56fd5b1f0d0a7fc3b6b0ded58e20d3d.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/b56fd5b1f0d0a7fc3b6b0ded58e20d3d.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A naturally airheaded lesser youkai who joined the Reform Organization to collect the wages Reimu still</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >owes her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has the highest starting stats of all characters, along with the strongest survival skill. Her melee build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is also extremely powerful. Simple, straightforward, and undeniably strong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~The Jealous Hashihime Youkai~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parsee Mizuhashi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/70665d0ef28d445601b3535a0169a316.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/70665d0ef28d445601b3535a0169a316.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/70665d0ef28d445601b3535a0169a316.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A youkai from the Underworld who is jealous at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she has a twisted personality, she is strangely cute in her own way. According to Parsee herself,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she joined the Reform Organization in pursuit of a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under normal circumstances, her combat ability is fairly ordinary. But once she gets hit, her jealousy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explodes. Make full use of her love-hate relationship with her enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~The Weak and Nameless Book-loving Youkai~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tokiko</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/3b87da7029c9fae1ca8ecad8de790b1a.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/3b87da7029c9fae1ca8ecad8de790b1a.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/3b87da7029c9fae1ca8ecad8de790b1a.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A literary youkai who loves reading, but has a very frail body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because she was often bullied by Reimu and Marisa in the past, she has a strong grudge against shrine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maidens. She is rather timid by nature, and in battle she is the most unusual character of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has only two hearts. In her initial state, all of her abilities are extremely low. She fghts with books as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her weapon, and she cannot upgrade her skills. At frst glance, she looks incredibly weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But give her some time to grow, and perhaps she may surprise you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/ac3083a4ecb030465224340acdd4d9be.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/ac3083a4ecb030465224340acdd4d9be.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/ac3083a4ecb030465224340acdd4d9be.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~The Closed Eye of Koishi~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Koishi Komeiji</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/fe4352e3211d0818a4c3906b4207fef1.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/fe4352e3211d0818a4c3906b4207fef1.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/fe4352e3211d0818a4c3906b4207fef1.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious and adorable youkai who may appear during your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating her three times, could she actually become your companion?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She uses the power of the unconscious to weave through enemy crowds, unleashing massive burst</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >damage with her unique skills. What new variables will her arrival bring to the operation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~Youkai of the Dusk~ </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9103ebc108fac8e3b4e0b2581b6b691d.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=604 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9103ebc108fac8e3b4e0b2581b6b691d.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9103ebc108fac8e3b4e0b2581b6b691d.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innocent darkness youkai, perpetually shrouded in thick black mist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason, the sealing ribbon on her head seems a bit looser than usual,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and she's somehow wielding a power far beyond her usual limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still... she doesn't quite give off that &quot;extremely dangerous&quot; vibe, does she? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I suppose it's fine to let her join the operation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More youkai will join in future updates...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous! A Dazzling Variety of Danmaku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every type of danmaku has its own unique purpose. Equip them onto your weapons and unleash your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >frepower in the most spectacular way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/8daf6327af4fec62aeda8b64a1ee99d4.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/8daf6327af4fec62aeda8b64a1ee99d4.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/8daf6327af4fec62aeda8b64a1ee99d4.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More danmaku will be added in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drinks, and Even More Drinks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strong have always stood alone — but only those who drink leave their names</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a wide variety of drinks, each providing diferent passive efects. Choosing the right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >drinks, character passives, and danmaku for each situation is one of the keys to becoming truly powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine “dubious drinks” with “danmaku” and reach the peak of exhilarating, drunken bliss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/a83a23e024c8eaacb7f115ca3d5b58df.avif?t=1781075695\" width=730 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More drinks will be added in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection Room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the bar lies a collection room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The youkai store the danmaku and drinks they have collected there, allowing everyone to admire and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >savor them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/2d404468995a29adba96469714707a32.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/2d404468995a29adba96469714707a32.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/2d404468995a29adba96469714707a32.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t even think about sneaking anything out of the storage room. That’s against the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marisa Kirisame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magician who resolves incidents, and one of the targets of the youkai’s rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She specializes in high-powered magic. Recently, she has been developing mushroom danmaku, and will</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >attack you with overwhelming waves of star-shaped bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9ac5129039e957256aea5c9d15b123d4.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9ac5129039e957256aea5c9d15b123d4.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9ac5129039e957256aea5c9d15b123d4.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reimu Hakurei</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shrine maiden who resolves incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feared by countless lesser youkai, she is the main target of this rebellion. Though she is a lazy and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unreasonable shrine maiden, her combat ability is overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the youkai truly defeat her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/f2fa73f688d57a9c40ff54633d2ef1eb.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/f2fa73f688d57a9c40ff54633d2ef1eb.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/f2fa73f688d57a9c40ff54633d2ef1eb.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More powerful enemies will appear in future updates!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lesser youkai of Gensokyo have long since seen the truth: whether during incident resolutions or in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >everyday life, the Hakurei shrine maiden and her allies never spare a thought for their feelings, bullying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >them however they please.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having endured enough, the lesser youkai decide to fight back. They form the <strong>Youkai Reform</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organization</strong>, using a lively youkai bar as their base of operations, recruiting like-minded allies from far</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and wide. In this glorious rebellion from below, they swear to reclaim the justice that belongs to them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/dacef9050ff22161ad3caa741a7e4c61.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/dacef9050ff22161ad3caa741a7e4c61.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/dacef9050ff22161ad3caa741a7e4c61.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touhou Drunken Rebellion</strong> is a top-down danmaku shooting roguelike. Players take on the role of lesser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >youkai from Gensokyo and rise up against the powerful fgures who rule over it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out from your base and defeat every enemy you encounter! Unleash gorgeous, devastating danmaku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >barrages, or make clever use of special abilities and combat techniques. Along the way, collect a wide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >variety of drinks with unique passive efects, defeat the fnal boss, and bring your operation to a perfect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >conclusion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/0cb1ff9fec05adc7cd392c3893dd1d57.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/0cb1ff9fec05adc7cd392c3893dd1d57.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/0cb1ff9fec05adc7cd392c3893dd1d57.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~The Forgotten Karakasa Youkai~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kogasa Tatara  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/b56fd5b1f0d0a7fc3b6b0ded58e20d3d.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/b56fd5b1f0d0a7fc3b6b0ded58e20d3d.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/b56fd5b1f0d0a7fc3b6b0ded58e20d3d.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A naturally airheaded lesser youkai who joined the Reform Organization to collect the wages Reimu still</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >owes her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has the highest starting stats of all characters, along with the strongest survival skill. Her melee build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is also extremely powerful. Simple, straightforward, and undeniably strong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~The Jealous Hashihime Youkai~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parsee Mizuhashi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/70665d0ef28d445601b3535a0169a316.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/70665d0ef28d445601b3535a0169a316.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/70665d0ef28d445601b3535a0169a316.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A youkai from the Underworld who is jealous at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though she has a twisted personality, she is strangely cute in her own way. According to Parsee herself,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she joined the Reform Organization in pursuit of a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under normal circumstances, her combat ability is fairly ordinary. But once she gets hit, her jealousy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explodes. Make full use of her love-hate relationship with her enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~The Weak and Nameless Book-loving Youkai~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tokiko</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/3b87da7029c9fae1ca8ecad8de790b1a.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/3b87da7029c9fae1ca8ecad8de790b1a.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/3b87da7029c9fae1ca8ecad8de790b1a.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A literary youkai who loves reading, but has a very frail body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because she was often bullied by Reimu and Marisa in the past, she has a strong grudge against shrine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maidens. She is rather timid by nature, and in battle she is the most unusual character of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has only two hearts. In her initial state, all of her abilities are extremely low. She fghts with books as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her weapon, and she cannot upgrade her skills. At frst glance, she looks incredibly weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But give her some time to grow, and perhaps she may surprise you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/ac3083a4ecb030465224340acdd4d9be.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/ac3083a4ecb030465224340acdd4d9be.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/ac3083a4ecb030465224340acdd4d9be.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~The Closed Eye of Koishi~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Koishi Komeiji</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/fe4352e3211d0818a4c3906b4207fef1.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/fe4352e3211d0818a4c3906b4207fef1.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/fe4352e3211d0818a4c3906b4207fef1.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious and adorable youkai who may appear during your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating her three times, could she actually become your companion?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She uses the power of the unconscious to weave through enemy crowds, unleashing massive burst</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >damage with her unique skills. What new variables will her arrival bring to the operation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~Youkai of the Dusk~ </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9103ebc108fac8e3b4e0b2581b6b691d.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=604 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9103ebc108fac8e3b4e0b2581b6b691d.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9103ebc108fac8e3b4e0b2581b6b691d.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innocent darkness youkai, perpetually shrouded in thick black mist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason, the sealing ribbon on her head seems a bit looser than usual,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and she's somehow wielding a power far beyond her usual limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still... she doesn't quite give off that &quot;extremely dangerous&quot; vibe, does she? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I suppose it's fine to let her join the operation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More youkai will join in future updates...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous! A Dazzling Variety of Danmaku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every type of danmaku has its own unique purpose. Equip them onto your weapons and unleash your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >frepower in the most spectacular way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/8daf6327af4fec62aeda8b64a1ee99d4.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/8daf6327af4fec62aeda8b64a1ee99d4.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/8daf6327af4fec62aeda8b64a1ee99d4.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More danmaku will be added in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drinks, and Even More Drinks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strong have always stood alone — but only those who drink leave their names</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a wide variety of drinks, each providing diferent passive efects. Choosing the right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >drinks, character passives, and danmaku for each situation is one of the keys to becoming truly powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine “dubious drinks” with “danmaku” and reach the peak of exhilarating, drunken bliss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/a83a23e024c8eaacb7f115ca3d5b58df.avif?t=1781075695\" width=730 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More drinks will be added in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection Room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the bar lies a collection room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The youkai store the danmaku and drinks they have collected there, allowing everyone to admire and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >savor them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/2d404468995a29adba96469714707a32.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/2d404468995a29adba96469714707a32.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/2d404468995a29adba96469714707a32.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t even think about sneaking anything out of the storage room. That’s against the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marisa Kirisame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magician who resolves incidents, and one of the targets of the youkai’s rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She specializes in high-powered magic. Recently, she has been developing mushroom danmaku, and will</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >attack you with overwhelming waves of star-shaped bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9ac5129039e957256aea5c9d15b123d4.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9ac5129039e957256aea5c9d15b123d4.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/9ac5129039e957256aea5c9d15b123d4.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reimu Hakurei</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shrine maiden who resolves incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feared by countless lesser youkai, she is the main target of this rebellion. Though she is a lazy and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unreasonable shrine maiden, her combat ability is overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the youkai truly defeat her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/f2fa73f688d57a9c40ff54633d2ef1eb.poster.avif?t=1781075695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/f2fa73f688d57a9c40ff54633d2ef1eb.webm?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045660/extras/f2fa73f688d57a9c40ff54633d2ef1eb.mp4?t=1781075695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More powerful enemies will appear in future updates!</p>",
        "short_description": "Touhou Drunken Rebellion is a classic top-down danmaku shooting roguelike game. Set in the world of Touhou Project, players take on the role of various lesser youkai living in Gensokyo and set out on a journey of rebellion against the powerful figures who rule over it.",
